\section{Abstract sentence structure}{

The sentence is assembled from available components in this order:
\enumerate{
\item Lead: \code{"Among [N] total calls, "}.
\item OR clause (if \code{logistic_fit} is non-\code{NULL}): primary clause.
\item IRR clause (if \code{poisson_fit} is non-\code{NULL}): primary clause when
no OR is present; otherwise appended after a semicolon.
\item LMM beta clause (if \code{lmm_fit} is non-\code{NULL}): primary clause when
no OR or IRR is present; otherwise appended after a semicolon.
\item Absolute gap suffix (if \code{acceptance_rate} is non-\code{NULL}): appended
as \code{", with an absolute [outcome_label] gap of [X] percentage points ([ref]\% vs. [comparison]\%)"}.
}
